flowchart TD
    DNS[Global DNS\nGeoDNS / Anycast]
    DNS -->|nearest region| EU[Region: EU-WEST]
    DNS -->|nearest region| US[Region: US-EAST]
    DNS -->|nearest region| AP[Region: AP-SOUTHEAST]

    EU <-->|async replication| US
